Click & collect is available alongside standard in-store shopping, and the clinic keeps slightly shorter hours than the main pharmacy floor. Trading from Sitari Village Centre on Old Main Road in Croydon, the branch serves the Sitari Fields area with pharmacy and wellness services close to home.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.dischem.co.za/sitari-fields-somerset-west'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'dis-chem-sitari-fields-croydon' AND description = 'Dis-Chem Sitari Fields is a branch of the Dis-Chem pharmacy chain, offering a dispensary and health, beauty and wellness products from the Sitari Village Centre, Croydon.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
-- distell-epping (researched)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Distell is one of Africa''s leading producers and marketers of wines, spirits, ciders and other ready-to-drink beverages, with a significant bottling and merchandising presence in Cape Town. The Epping Industria site includes a large bottling operation known as Green Park, alongside a separate warehouse used for merchandising activities.

Based on Bofors Circle in Epping Industria, one of Cape Town''s most central industrial areas, the site sits close to major road links including the N1, N2, N7 and M5. It forms part of the beverage production and distribution network that supplies Distell''s wine, spirits and cider brands to retailers across the region.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.airportproperty.co.za/new-premises-for-distell-in-epping-industrial-park/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'distell-epping' AND description = 'Distell Green Park is a beverage bottling and distribution facility in Epping Industria operated by Distell, one of Africa''s leading producers of wines, spirits, ciders and ready-to-drink beverages.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
