The station is at the corner of Doncaster Road and Punters Way in Kenilworth, serving commuters and residents passing through the suburb. It is a straightforward stop for fuel, a quick snack, or basic forecourt services without needing to detour far from the main road through Kenilworth.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'doncaster-motors-kenilworth' AND description = 'Doncaster Motors is a fuel station in Kenilworth at the corner of Doncaster Road and Punters Way, with a Caltex FreshStop convenience store on site.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
